msgid ""
"%s\n"
"\n"
"Suggested subjective evaluation criteria:\n"
"Did anyone suggest using probes to gather data?\n"
"Did Relay put out waypoints for guidance around the planets?\n"
"Did Engineering boost maneuver for Helm? Did Helm request a maneuver boost?\n"
"Was Weapons diligent about the shields?\n"
"Did Science let everyone know when the data was gathered for a planet?"
msgstr ""

